WEBVTT

00:01:58.515 --> 00:02:01.575
Inamaanisha kuna mtu huko nje
alikula pauni 400 ya nyama.

00:02:01.599 --> 00:02:03.686
(Kicheko)

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.415
Kwa njia tunayoelekea,

00:02:05.439 --> 00:02:10.127
tunaenda kuhitaji kuzalisha asilimia
70 hadi 100 zaidi ya nyama ifikapo 2050.

00:02:10.151 --> 00:02:12.618
Hili linahitaji suluhisho la duniani pote.

00:02:13.317 --> 00:02:17.270
Tunachohitaji ni kuzalisha nyama 
ambayo watu watapenda,

00:02:17.294 --> 00:02:19.793
lakini tuizalishe kwa njia mpya.

00:02:20.465 --> 00:02:22.323
Nina mawazo kadhaa.

00:02:22.347 --> 00:02:25.789
Wazo la kwanza:
tukuze nyama kutoka kwa mimea.

00:02:25.813 --> 00:02:28.262
Badala ya kukuza mimea,
kuyalisha kwa wanyama,

00:02:28.286 --> 00:02:29.720
na hayo yote yasiyofaa,

00:02:29.744 --> 00:02:32.649
tukuze mimea hiyo,
tuikuze na nyama,